! TEST 16: GDI MENU pages, L>30, inversion and right clipping
GRAF
CFON 1
CSIM 15
CLSC
SIZE 35
DATA 1;35;@data
! PgDn: items 31..35. PgUp: items 01..30. Use arrows, then Enter.
MENU 35;40;1;45;F
TEXT
LIST 'MENU selected item =';F
EXIT
@data
